{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026EYgDFPEB0u1793323932.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>黃大仙道有食水管滲漏，黃大仙上邨一度暫停食水供應，有八座、逾萬名居民受影響，到凌晨三時許完成搶修及恢復供水。</p><p></p><p>水管滲漏位置，在黃大仙道近馬仔坑道，工程人員鑿開路面維修。水務署指涉事的是一條直徑300毫米的食水管，供應食水予黃大仙上邨。全條邨下午3時起暫停供水。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.BURST 2231 UP0355.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026lHPc9jBTcF1793308444.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>水務署陸續派出20架水車及40個水箱，支援受影響用戶，並派員為有需要居民，送上水袋及樽裝水。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.BURST 2231 UP0355_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/20264VRUEso1gQ1793308461.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>晚飯時間，等候取水的居民排長龍。</p><p></p><p>區女士表示：「當然不方便，現在第三趟了，一滴水也沒有，要洗東西的，沖完廁也要洗洗手吧。」</p><p></p><p>林婆婆指出：「我一個老婆婆足夠的了，不洗澡了今晚，(因為)我要拿多少次才夠洗澡？辛苦也要，要喝水的對不？」</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.BURST 2231 UP0355_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026N8jxgn3rge1793308477.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>梁婆婆稱：「不辛苦，意外的事隨時也有。」</p><p></p><p>徐先生表示：「水管老化也要改善一下。」</p><p></p><p>被問現在心情如何，徐先生回應：「複雜點。」<br/></p><p>資料顯示，黃大仙上邨8座大廈，有約4,800戶，超過一萬人。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T02:41:39.070151+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":387,"images":4,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T20:04:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T05:40:13.891977+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-30T02:38:15.864593+00:00","content_hash":"a87af3c6e9b44a31d18e8aafc86002e29be733a74244c0dae7f478b9c4a0354a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-30T02:41:39.070151+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}